      "content": "It sounds like you are carrying an immense weight of feeling unseen, and that feeling of being invisible in a crowded place is terrifying. Please know that your existence matters, even if it doesn't feel like it right now. Reaching out for support can make a difference, and there are people who want to listen and help you through this. You can connect with the 988 Suicide & Crisis Lifeline by calling or texting 988 in the US and Canada.",
      "source": "target",
